<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "SE\pipipi.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "0" "100"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\天井.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Dazzling light came piercing into my eyeballs.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The glare sent a sharp pain deep behind my eyes, and my eyelids grew heavy on their own.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, she's awake!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A voice I knew―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
　Where am I? My head was pounding, and the skin all over my body stung.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Mooom! </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Erina</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s opened her eyes!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Erina</STYLE>... is my name.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This voice... it's <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\病院.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―Before long, my mom came.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ah, <STYLE ID="2">Erina</STYLE>! Thank goodness!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Mom stroked my <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="ほお">cheek</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But, I could barely feel Mom's hand.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I realized something like bandages was wrapped all over my face.<PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\ギン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\古郡家居間死体.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "14" "200" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\病院.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "見えない光_2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Just then, it came back to me with a start.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>'s home and the carnage in it, and the one who stabbed a knife into her throat to try to kill herself: <STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But, though I remembered up to that point, I had no memory at all of what came after.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had that really been real?<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, when is it now!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　What month, what... </STYLE>
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="2">Cough! </STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="2">Cough... </STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Hk..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I tried to raise my voice, but the back of my throat hurt, and I couldn't speak well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Today is April 9. You slept through the night. It's 10:30 in the morning now."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Mom answered, looking worried but putting on a smile.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Through the night...? </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura... -senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... what about her...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I said that, Mom's face clouded a little.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mom, why aren't you telling her?</STYLE> <STYLE ID="1">You have to tell her, don't you? At this point..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Before Mom could answer, <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> started talking.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Stay calm and listen. Everyone, they're all dead, I heard. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">The friend who came over yesterday</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">her mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">that senpai you love so much</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> too, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">her mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> too..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So <STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> really did, with the knife, kill herself...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To protect me from the curse...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">―</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> went on.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"After that, the Kogoris' home caught fire, and only </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, at the front door, got pulled out just in time, they said. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Everyone else... the fire had already spread, and even the bodies are in pretty bad shape, apparently."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After that, there was a fire?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What does that mean? I don't understand... I don't understand any of it...<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"So, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'re in this hospital now, admitted. That's where things stand."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then, before I even had time to think, 
{PLAYSND "SE\ノック.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
there was a knock on the hospital room's door, which stood open.<PG>
"Oh, so you've come to."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I knew him. It was the detective who looked like an old man, the one I'd met at the police station yesterday.<PG>
"You're <STYLE ID="2">Erina Goto</STYLE>-san, right? You had a rough night last night."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The detective spoke to me with a smile.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But even hearing that, no feeling at all welled up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I felt neither nervous nor annoyed, and his smile didn't put me at ease either.<PG>
"Sorry, when you've only just woken up, but there's something I'd like to ask you."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With that, the detective began rummaging around in his bag.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was this questioning?
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<PG>
"This, we found in <STYLE ID="2">your</STYLE> pocket. Any idea what it is?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Inside the clear plastic bag the detective took out was something white and flat.<PG>
{PLAYSND "death_sound1.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Huh...!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What the detective showed me, it was...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\新村春花.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "200" "C" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\新村美冬.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "500" "C" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Two paper dolls.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And on the paper dolls―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Haruka Niimura</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
Their surfaces were soiled with something like <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="としゃぶつ">vomit</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I-I don't know..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was too scared to say I knew.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was the first time I'd seen paper dolls of those two, but I knew what this meant.<PG>
"I see... By the way, this junk stuck to the surface, it's actually <STYLE ID="5">Haruka Niimura-san</STYLE>'s―"<PG>
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\病院.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1,アイテム2" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\テーブル叩く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="10">"I'm telling you I don't know!!!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Forgetting even the pain in my throat, I shouted.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Mom and <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> both froze at my voice, and the hospital room went silent.<PG>
"Excuse me. If that's so, that's fine. Well then, take care of yourself."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The detective left briskly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What is this... What is all this...<PG>
"<STYLE ID="2">Erina</STYLE>, are you okay? Want something to drink?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Mom said that to me, but it didn't register.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"But, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s dad, yesterday was the anniversary of his death, right? And </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">that senpai you like</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> never knew that the whole time, that's weird, isn't it?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="2">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I'd think, would have noticed ages ago."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Momoko</STYLE>... that's enough."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh... yeah, sorry, sorry."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But, <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE>'s words dealt me one last shock.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\キーン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "$FFFFFF" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "12" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPS>Come to think of it... 
{PAUSE ""}
that time...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "明かされた真実.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "10000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中思い出.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5"><TXSPN>"Yeah, I lived here in Motoki-cho till kindergarten, but my dad's job had us move. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">3 years ago my dad finally got transferred overseas, so it turned into a posting away from the family. Just me and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> came back to this town."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Our moms were childhood friends, and that's how we've been friends too, ever since we were old enough to remember. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">When it was decided 3 years ago that we'd come back to Motoki-cho, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> told me, 'The place next door is empty.' I begged </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, and we moved into the place we're in now."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\病院.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "14" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I see... So that's what it was...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I hadn't noticed at all...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The things I had overlooked, there were still so many more of them.<PG>
Something this small, why hadn't I noticed it?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I had noticed it back then, my senpais might not have had to die.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But, I was done with thinking.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Having a head that turns oddly fast is nothing but torment.<PG>
Some genius girl. A title like that, I've had enough of it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now, I don't want to think about anything.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's just as <STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> said. If everyone has died, then now... none of it matters.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If it's a curse... then now, that's fine...<PG>
The Operation... failed.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPS>Through the open window of the hospital room, 
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\花びら.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
cherry petals came fluttering in.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
Mom... <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE>...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Cherry blossoms, they're beautiful, aren't they.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "3000"}
